      {
        "_uid": "78ad1d94-5213-150c-5df9-6e84e7c1d6cf",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The Level B1 course structure revolves around speaking and writing in English in work-related situations. A particular feature is expanding English vocabulary and skills you can apply to business negotiations, telephone conversations, written reports and emails, and professional presentations. The Level B2 course focuses on developing the communication skills needed to meet clients, write business proposals and make recommendations, present product concepts and project plan, organise staff training and discuss costs and budgets.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Our goal is to provide you the best English Language experience possible. The Business English course incorporates small class sizes, more opportunities to learn, practice, improve and excel in English communication. Come and join us by booking yourself a business class seat in 2019!",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
